## Do
- Utilities in `className` only — no CSS-in-JS
- Check `lib/tailwind.ts` before adding layout, section, or CTA classes
- Interactive controls ≥ `min-h-11` + visible `:focus-visible` ring
- `shrink-0` · slash opacity · theme shadows (`shadow-gold-*`, `shadow-nav`, `shadow-focus-gold`)
- RTL → `03-rtl-urdu.mdc`

## Don't
- `@tailwindcss/typography` / `prose-*`
- Inline `style={{}}` for colors/gradients/shadows (OK: `--hero-delay`, LCP blur, `--nav-indent`)
- Raw hex for brand UI · duplicate arbitrary rgba shadows
- `@apply` except base/rich-text in `globals.css`
- Duplicate: `max-w-* mx-auto px-*` → `TW_CONTAINER*` · `py-16 sm:py-20` → `TW_SECTION_PY` · eyebrow line → `TW_EYEBROW_LINE` · muted subtitle → `TW_PAGE_SUBTITLE`

## Brand exceptions
PayPal (`TW_PAYPAL_CTA`), WhatsApp float (`TW_WHATSAPP_FLOAT`) only.

Skill: `tailwind-ui` · verify: `preflight` + `rtl-check` after Urdu UI.
